e": "PhysixLab (6).png", "id": "1662201552194070", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622186_1662201555527403_2815929584937412710_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U7ZXGjTRFzQQ7kNvwHT7rd1&_nc_oc=Adp2p-crfckkXh9feLiqw0xFa1OvNTfDJlhKMJ67mrWOPw7aqQ1gyQ0Vhd2tMON7_bQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS8KnpkvQ4Fwcjdiy96eDvSPnFNpDz8gR2mWH5fKG4JIA&oe=6AFF34C6"}, "display_name": "PhysixLab", "keywords": ["physics", "sandbox", "playground", "ragdoll", "realistic"], "long_description": "**Full Physics Interaction**\n\nEvery part of your body from head to toe is fully physics-based, even your fingers! Every object has been carefully crafted to maximize physics interaction and collision fidelity.\n\n{1338880328236817}\n\n**10 Unique Maps, Many More to Come**\n\n10 fun maps full of physics interactions, with many more to come in the near future!\n\n{2559459274567465}\n\n**Physics-Based Flipping**\n\nDo true physics-based flips using the ragdoll toggle and swinging your arms in the direction you want to flip. Any flip is possible from backflips, frontflips, sideflips, to even twists!\n\n{3021761941516886}\n\n**Power-Ups**\n\nCertain foods give you special power-ups like increased speed, jump power, strength, and more!\n\n{1782837572987597}", "short_description": "PhysixLab is a physics-based sandbox in which you can mess around with fun physics."}]}, "developer_name": "physixlabstudios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eQaKWTLkIyLfv3X3T3DdooV6pT0ooKtpSGSduEyCckA/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "physixlabstudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://physixlabstudio.wordpress.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"i